<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">i). In terms of Reg 33 of the SEBI (LODR) 2015 as amended, the above unaudited Statement of Consolidated FR of the Group has been reviewed by Audit Committee and approved by BOD at their respective meetings held on June 30, 2024. The statutory auditors have carried out a limited review of the results on these consolidated financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2024 and have issued an unmodified conclusion.   ii). The BoD of one of the Subsidiary Company, Shyam Sel &amp; Power Limited, at its meeting held on August 31, 2022, had considered and approved the merger of SSEL’s wholly owned subsidiary, namely, Hrashva Storage and Warehousing Private Limited (‘HSWPL’) into SSEL by way of a scheme of amalgamation. The Kolkata Bench of the Hon’ble NCLT approved the scheme with appointed date of merger being April 1, 2022 vide its order dated Sept 22, 2023.     iii). The BoD of SSEL, at its meeting held on August 31, 2022, had considered &amp; approved the amended resolution plan for acquisition &amp; subsequent merger of Mittal Corp. Limited into SSEL by way of resolution plan &amp; amalgamation scheme dated Feb 17, 2023. The Mumbai Bench of the Hon’ble NCLT approved the resolution plan with appointed date being February 17, 2023, vide its order dated October 18, 2023.     iv). The BOD of SSEL, at its meeting held on October 25, 2022, had considered and approved merger of SSEL’s wholly owned subsidiary namely, Platinum Minmet Private Limited (‘PMPL’) into SSEL by way of a composite scheme of amalgamation. The Kolkata Bench of Hon’ble NCLT approved this composite scheme of amalgamation with the appointed date of the merger being April 01, 2022, vide its order dated January 25, 2024.    vi). The Group is primarily engaged in the manufacturing of steel and allied products including pellets, sponge iron, TMT and long products, ferro alloys, aluminium, stainless steel and generation of power. Accordingly, steel and allied products is the only reportable business segment in line with the segment wise information which is being presented to the CODM in accordance with Ind AS 108 — Segment Reporting.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
